Package: tabpro
Version: [[version]]
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: openjdk-25-jre | java-runtime (>= 25)
Recommends: fluid-soundfont-gm
Maintainer: Gastón Caruso <gstn.caruso@gmail.com>
Description: Guitar tablature editor
 Free Guitar Pro 5 clone.
 .
 Recommends fluid-soundfont-gm (MIT license) to replace the JDK's internal
 MIDI synthesizer with a realistic soundbank. Without it, tabpro still works
 with the internal sound.
